# route: level=w3_l1_coop difficulty=beginner players=2 ends=exit after=level:w3_l1b_coop expect=wipes:0,eggs:0,x2_gates:2,min_checkpoints:3,painting:24
# w3_l1_coop Beginner two-stream route: "Frost Summit" for two (designer DB2; ticks:P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S; recorded
# from closed-loop duo bots, build/db2/bot_w3_l1_coop.gd --cave=1). A Shellback pincer on the ramp top; the x2 ice
# cave: both crouch through the hatch on the near shore, P1 holds the plate (crouch taps) while P2 runs through the ice
# door to the nook (the U, painting 24, the treasure) and back, both climb the vine out; floe to floe over the frozen
# lake; gate 'lake': both step into the ice tunnel, P1 wakes the Bull Rex and runs back, both crouch side by side (a
# Brace Wall stops it dead) and club it while it is dazed - the ice door opens; up the zigzag of ledges to the rock
# step; gate 'cliff': P1 hops off P2's head onto the clifftop and clubs the coiled vine down, P2 climbs it; a
# Shellback pincer in the valley; at the water pit both wait facing the slope until the ridge chargers have rushed
# down into the pit; the Shellback at the top of the slope (P2 hops over and baits it from the half slope, P1 clubs
# its back from below); over the ridge and up the summit steps into the exit.
